msgstr ""
"\n"
"U '-newerXY', XY označava kombinaciju [aBcm][aBcmt]; pogledajte find(1).\n"
"\n"

#: find/util.c:212
msgid ""
"\n"
"Use '-D help' for a description of the options, or see find(1).\n"
